Textured, rigged + animated builder avatar generated with Meshy (image-to-3D) from a
Cubicraftia minifigure reference, cleaned via headless Blender (stray mesh removed).
Skeleton: 24 bones; animations include Walking/Running. Original Cubicraftia asset.
